    "featureForm": "action",
    "description": "<p><strong>Spend a Fear</strong> to have the @Lookup[@name] unleash a terrifying, ear-splitting goose honk. Each PC within Close range must make a Presence Reaction Roll. Targets who fail must mark a Stress, move away from the @Lookup[@name] to Far range, and become <em>Vulnerable</em> until the @Lookup[@name] deals damage to them. Targets who succeed must mark a Stress or move away from the @Lookup[@name] to Far range.</p>",
